sparky-beep (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * MAJOR UPDATE: Configuration Management & Extended Multilingual Support
  * Added TUI/GUI/CLI configuration interfaces (sparky-beep-config)
  * Added tune/melody library management with 10+ built-in melodies
  * Implemented time-based scheduling with quiet hours support
  * Added composer and player tools for creating custom beep sequences
  * Expanded internationalization from 15 to 26 languages
  * Added 11 new language translations (Arabic, Catalan, Danish, Greek,
    Finnish, Hungarian, Korean, Portuguese Brazil, Romanian, Slovak,
    Traditional Chinese)
  * New libraries: config.sh, discovery.sh, tunes.sh, scheduler.sh
  * Enhanced documentation and test coverage (228 tests, ~85% core coverage)
  * Configuration file support: /etc/sparky-beep/beep.conf
  * Automatic configuration backup system
  * Service enable/disable management
  * Custom tune assignment for each service event
  * Schedule rules for time-based beep control

 -- Capitain_Jack and Claude <sparky-os@example.com>  Wed, 20 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000

